{"id":"tishe","lemma":"тише","pos":"intj","rank":781,"glosses":["silence!"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a9/Ru-%D1%82%D0%B8%D1%88%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D1%82%D0%B8%D1%88%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ты можешь быть тише, пожалуйста?","en":"Can you please be quiet?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to be"},null,{"g":"please"}]},{"text":"Мы должны говорить тише.","en":"We should lower our voices.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"to speak, to talk"},null]},{"text":"Тебе надо было говорить тише.","en":"You should've spoken more quietly.","words":[{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},{"g":"must, necessary"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"to speak, to talk"},null]},{"text":"Мать сказала детям вести себя тише.","en":"The mother told the children to be quiet.","words":[{"g":"mother"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},{"g":"child","l":"ребёнок"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"to behave"]]},{"text":"В деревне тише, чем в городе.","en":"It's quieter in the countryside than in town.","words":[{"g":"in"},null,null,{"g":"than"},{"g":"in"},null]}]}